msgctxt "120"
msgid "Oh, sensei! I've been waiting for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "...Sensei? The hell?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Remember me? You helped me at the burger joint and outside\r\n"
"that cabaret club!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Oh... you again? What do you want this time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Well, after we last met, I tried real hard to get a date\r\n"
"all on my own, but no matter what I do, I can't get a girl\r\n"
"to go on a second date, let alone a first!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"So I decided to come here... and ask you to teach me how\r\n"
"to talk to women!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"I want to know everything you know. Will you come with me,\r\n"
"just over there? Please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Well, all right."
msgstr "...Beh, d'accordo."

